  nonce: f80f  # f80f
  message: "Pass-40 F40.A4+A5+D3 batch — F37.B2/B3 refinements + methodology calibration.\n\nF40.A4 (F37.B2 enumeration extension): F37 enumerated 3 EP kinds for compact-default drop rates (library_export 82.6%, shell_script 80.6%, http_route 0%). Pass-40 confirms those exactly + completes the table:\n| kind | total | survived | drop_pct |\n| library_export | 46 | 8 | 82.6% (CONFIRM) |\n| shell_script | 36 | 7 | 80.6% (CONFIRM) |\n| main_function | 11 | 7 | 36.4% (NEW) |\n| http_route | 8 | 8 | 0.0% (CONFIRM) |\n| script_module | 2 | 2 | 0.0% (NEW) |\n| html_entry | 1 | 1 | 0.0% (NEW) |\nEmpirical rule: any kind with total<=8 has drop=0 (low-cardinality kinds 100% survive connectivity-aware selection). F37's 3-kind framing was a slice, not the full table.\n\nF40.A5 (F37.B3 package × kind cross-tab): F37 said 'scripts/bash 100%'. Fresh substrate: scripts/ package drop = 94.3% (33/35 dropped). The 2 survivors are both Python main_function EPs (scripts/compute_probe_embeddings.py, scripts/backfill-training-data-cohort-tags.py). The bash subset within scripts/ is 29/29 = 100% — confirms F37 for the kind subset but pass-37's framing conflated package with kind. Full per-package table: scripts 94.3% / hypergumbo-core 88.2% / hypergumbo-tracker 6.7% / hypergumbo-lang-rust-analyzer 77.8% / .githooks 0% / htrac-frontend 0% / hypergumbo 0%. (package × kind) cross-tab needed to be unambiguous.\n\nF40.D3 (methodology calibration after F39.A1): F39.A1 invalidated a 4-pass chain (F34.A2 → F37.C1) via fresh substrate. Pass-40 re-applied the same methodology to 3 multi-pass-amplified claims sampled from passes 32+34+35:\n- F34.A1 (--fw all → 33 violations): pass-40 measures 33 EXACT MATCH (axis_conformance:20, id_format:13)\n- F35.A1 (--include-docs → 4321 violations): pass-40 measures 4321 EXACT MATCH (id_format:4321)\n- F32.1 cold-side (bash 696.5 ms/file): pass-40 measures 678.81 ms/file on identical 42-file scope (within 3% noise) — CONFIRMED. F32.1 warm-side (11.2× spread) not reproducible by simple re-invocation; methodology-dependent.\n3 of 3 sampled claims hold up. F39.A1's invalidation appears sui generis (specific to features-count cross-flag substrate-comparison) rather than a generalized 'every multi-pass amplification is suspect' pattern. **Methodological-lesson refinement**: the fresh-substrate discipline that pass 39 introduced is still correct (it did catch F37.C1) but should not be expected to invalidate at high frequency. Most multi-pass-amplified findings ARE real."  # f80f
