  new_text: "Pass-34 batch — INV-luhur faces staying on this row (F34.A1 validator-fixture-coverage migrated to WI-himoj per fold-audit Phase 2b; F34.A2 INVALIDATED by pass-39 F39.A1 — left as methodology-calibration record; F34.A3 profile.frameworks 171-entry flag-echo retained).\n\n**F34.A2 — Feature emission gated on auto-detect mode only (METHODOLOGICALLY INVALIDATED by pass-39 F39.A1; preserved here as historical record).** Original framing claimed `--frameworks all` AND `--frameworks none` produce ZERO features (vs default's 16). Pass-39 fresh substrate re-generation showed ROOT `--fw all` actually produces features=16 (not 0). The pass-34 measurement was a single-substrate mismeasurement that propagated across passes 34-37 before pass-39 invalidated it. Methodological lesson: substantive negative findings repeated across passes should be verified by fresh substrate generation. F39.A1 / F39.A2 catalog this in the pass-39 entry.\n\n**F34.A3 — `--frameworks all` profile.frameworks = 171 entries (full catalog dump).** profile.frameworks lists the flag value verbatim — all 171 frameworks the catalog knows — regardless of detection. 11 distinct framework_role values appear in actual node.meta data (websocket_endpoint, event_subscriber, event_publisher, grpc_servicer, grpc_stub, http_client, graphql_resolver, route, mq_publisher, mq_subscriber, graphql_client). **Intersection between the 171 declared frameworks and the 11 observed framework_role values: 0.** The two surfaces use disjoint vocabularies: profile.frameworks lists framework-package names (django, flask, starlette, lit, react, vue, ...); meta.framework_role uses role-pattern names (route, http_client, event_publisher, ...). Same finding-family as pass-25 F25.17 (profile.frameworks=['lit','starlette'] with 0 node-level references) — pass-34 extends to scale with `--frameworks all` (83× more declared frameworks).\n\nFix-path candidates for F34.A3: (a) filter profile.frameworks to detected-only at emission time, (b) document the field as \"flag value echoed verbatim\", or (c) split into profile.frameworks_requested vs profile.frameworks_detected.\n\n**Probe artifacts:** `/tmp/p34_fw_all.json` (140.8 MB) + `/tmp/p34_fw_none.json` (140.6 MB) substrates; `/tmp/p34_outputA.log` + `/tmp/p34_outputA2.log`; `/tmp/p34_probeA.py` / `/tmp/p34_probeA2.py` probe scripts."  # 9530
  reason: "fold-audit 2b: F34.A1 migrated; A2 invalidated; A3 kept"  # 9530
